</given-names></name><name><surname>Richard</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Rispal</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>TAT peptide internalization: Seeking the mechanism of entry</article-title><source>Current Protein &#x00026; Peptide Science</source><year>2003</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12678851</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Song</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Tong</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>Complete genome sequence of Yersinia pestis strain 91001, an isolate avirulent to humans</article-title><source>DNA Res</source><year>2004</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>97</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15368893</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><label>33</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Ulbrich</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Pechar</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Strohalm</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>Synthesis of biodegradable polymers for controlled drug release</article-title><source>Ann N Y Acad Sci</source><year>1997</year><volume>831</volume><fpage>47</fpage><lpage>56</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9616701</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><label>34</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Kopecek</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kopeckova</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Minko</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>HPMA copolymer-anticancer drug conjugates: design, activity, and mechanism of action</article-title><source>Eur J Pharm Biopharm</source><year>2000</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>61</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10840193</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B35"><label>35</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Kopecek</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kopeckova</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Minko</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>Water soluble polymers in tumor targeted delivery</article-title><source>Journal of Controlled Release</source><year>2001</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>147</fpage><lpage>58</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11489491</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B36"><label>36</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Gray</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Collins</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genome changes and gene expression in human solid tumors</article-title><source>Carcinogenesis</source><year>2000</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>443</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10688864</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B37"><label>37</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Merriefield</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Solid Phase Peptide Synthesis. I The Synthesis of a Tetrapeptide</article-title><source>J Americ Chem Soc</source><year>1963</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>2149</fpage><lpage>54</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B38"><label>38</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Carpino</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ionescu</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>El Faham</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>Complex polyfluoride additives in Fmoc-amino acid fluoride coupling processes. Enhanced reac